: Written by hand from the AG-UI specification, not recorded: subagents that run one after another and tag only the chunk that opens their message. SUBAGENT_FINISHED or SUBAGENT_ERROR closes the message of its subagent, so a chunk without an id continues the only message left open.
data: {"type":"RUN_STARTED","threadId":"thread-C","runId":"run-C1"}

